### AUTH

### Get USER JWT token
POST http://localhost:8180/realms/lab1/protocol/openid-connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

client_id=lab1-app&client_secret={{client_secret}}&username=user&password=user123&grant_type=password&scope=openid

> {%
    client.global.set("access_token", response.body.access_token);
%}


### Get ADMIN JWT token
POST http://localhost:8180/realms/lab1/protocol/openid-connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

client_id=lab1-app&client_secret={{client_secret}}&username=admin&password=admin123&grant_type=password&scope=openid

> {%
    client.global.set("admin_access_token", response.body.access_token);
%}


### JWT SECURITY

### API without JWT - expected 401
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tasks
Accept: application/json


### API with USER JWT - expected 200
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tasks
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}


### CRUD

### Create task
POST http://localhost:8080/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

{
  "title": "Finish laboratory work",
  "description": "Complete Spring Security laboratory work",
  "status": "TODO",
  "priority": "HIGH"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("task_id", response.body.id);
%}


### Get created task
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tasks/{{task_id}}
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}


### Update created task
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/tasks/{{task_id}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

{
  "title": "Finish laboratory work",
  "description": "CRUD part completed",
  "status": "IN_PROGRESS",
  "priority": "HIGH"
}


### Delete created task
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/tasks/{{task_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}


### Get deleted task - expected 404
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tasks/{{task_id}}
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}


### SECURITY FILTER CHAIN

### Admin endpoint as USER - expected 403
GET http://localhost:8080/api/admin/test
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}


### Admin endpoint as ADMIN - expected 200
GET http://localhost:8080/api/admin/test
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_access_token}}


### METHOD SECURITY - @PreAuthorize

### Method security as USER - expected 403
GET http://localhost:8080/api/method-security/test
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}


### Method security as ADMIN - expected 200
GET http://localhost:8080/api/method-security/test
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_access_token}}